  "title": "CAQM Proposes District-Level Pollution Action Plans in Delhi-NCR",
  "summary": "CAQM has requested Delhi and NCR states to prepare district-level pollution action plans for 2027, aiming to reduce pollution by 15-20% and include district-level measures. These plans will help in focused implementation and monitoring at the grassroots level, with clear accountability for implementation gaps.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "CAQM has asked Delhi and NCR states to prepare district-level action plans for 2027 to tackle air pollution and include district-level measures.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The order was issued by CAQM on November 20, 2024, and aims to address pollution challenges through district-level implementation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The plans will include sector-wise actions, measurable targets, and timelines for effective monitoring.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
